    </section>

    <section id="work">
      <h2>Work</h2>
      <ul class="entries">
        <li>
          <h3>Perth's Prospects</h3>
          <p>The first purpose-built global benchmarking of Greater Perth, commissioned by Infrastructure WA. Situates Perth and Peel Region against peer cities worldwide to inform long-term infrastructure and growth strategy.</p>
          <p class="meta">Infrastructure WA, 2025</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3><a href="https://committeeforbrisbane.org.au/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Benchmarking-SEQ-Web-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Benchmarking South East Queensland</a></h3>
          <p>Global benchmarking of SEQ ahead of the Brisbane 2032 Games, comparing the region across productivity, transport, liveability, and innovation against peer metro regions worldwide.</p>
          <p class="meta">Council of Mayors SEQ, 2024 to 2025</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3><a href="https://placeview.org/welcome" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Placeview</a></h3>
          <p>A place-analysis tool I'm building. Draw an area anywhere in thirteen metros, from London to Los Angeles, and see what's inside it, measured on a 100-metre grid.</p>
          <p class="meta">Side project, placeview.org</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3><a href="https://www.euki.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/SUNRISE-Project-Financing-for-Prosumer-Renewable-Energy-in-Lithuania-North-Macedonia-and-Bulgaria-November-2023-1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Financing Prosumer Renewable Energy in Lithuania, North Macedonia, and Bulgaria</a></h3>
          <p>Policy paper on enabling citizen-led renewable energy across three European states.</p>
          <p class="meta">EUKI, German Federal Ministry for Economic Affairs and Climate Action, 2023</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3><a href="https://carolinacartography.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Carolina Cartography</a></h3>
          <p>Mapping, narrative, and human geography. New perspectives on spaces, places, and geographic difference.</p>
          <p class="meta">carolinacartography.org</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="more">More of my projects are in <a href="https://thebusinessofcities.com/work/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">The Business of Cities portfolio</a>.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="writing">
      <h2>Writing</h2>
      <ul class="entries">
        <li>
          <h3><a href="https://kuleuven.limo.libis.be/discovery/fulldisplay?docid=alma9994890984001488&context=L&vid=32KUL_KUL:KULeuven&search_scope=All_Content&tab=all_content_tab&lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Coalition Cartography: Mapping Urban Governance and Transportation in 20th-Century California</a></h3>
          <p class="meta">Thesis, KU Leuven, 2024. LAGT Award for the Best Thesis in Geography.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
